### URL: https://www-dev.springfield.moz.works/get/

# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-language-not-available = Ez a { -brand-name-firefox } letöltés nem érhető el az Ön nyelvén innen: { $partner }. A lenti gomb megnyomásával továbbra is letöltheti a { -brand-name-firefox(case: "accusative") }.
# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-device-not-available = Ez a { -brand-name-firefox } letöltés nem érhető el az Ön eszközére innen: { $partner }. A lenti gomb megnyomásával továbbra is letöltheti a { -brand-name-firefox(case: "accusative") }.
# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-already-using-firefox = Már a { -brand-name-firefox(case: "accusative") } használja. Lépjen tovább a firefox.com webhelyre, hogy megnézze az újdonságokat.
# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-continue = Tovább a firefox.com webhelyre
# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-link-visit = { $partner } felkeresése
# Button text for a link to a company’s page.
partner-download-link-learn-more = További tudnivalók
